          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.44"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "45",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:45"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "45",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lembe pa Yehova de bino i bang’a, m’uwacu kumae, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.45",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.45"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "46",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:46"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "46",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wod dhanu, keth weng’i yor ariwa ma piny, man iton lembe yor ariwa ma piny, man ieu lembe kum luli m’i thim i yor ariwa ma piny: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.46",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.46"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "47",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:47"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "47",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "man iyer ni luli ma yor ariwa ma piny kumae, Winj lembe pa Yehova: Rwoth Yehova wacu kumae, Nen, abicwinyo mac i ii, man ebiwang’u yen m’uluk ii kubang’e kubang’e, ku yen m’uthwo kubang’e kubang’e: lebmac m’ubogre binegre ngo man wang’ ceke ugambre yor ariwa ma piny cil kum yor ariwa ma malu biwang’ kudo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.47",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.47"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "48",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:48"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "48",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man weg kum ceke bineno nia an, an a Yehova, acwinyo maeni; ebinegre ngo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.48",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.48"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "49",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:49"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "49",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alund awacu kumae, A Rwoth Yehova! giwacu pira kumae, En e jayer lembabola ngo?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.49",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.49"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
